DIVERGENTE Falcon - Industrialization Roadmap & Data Architecture
Executive Summary
This document outlines the complete industrialization strategy for the DIVERGENTE Falcon, a revolutionary aircraft powered by four parallel natural energy sources. We address the critical question: How do the 4 energy systems work in parallel while the falcon is in the sky? We then detail the data model, manufacturing process, and go-to-market strategy.

